  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p><strong>• About our brand and products:</strong></p><p>LMN Life is a performance-focused lifestyle brand offering premium nutritional supplements and functional apparel designed to support fitness, energy, and everyday performance.</p><p><strong>• What makes us different:</strong></p><p>We focus on high-quality ingredients, strict product testing, and results-driven formulas. Our products are built to help users improve performance and get the most out of their training and daily life.</p><p><strong>• How affiliates can earn:</strong></p><p>Affiliates earn 10% commission on every sale made through their referral link. The more you promote, the more you earn.</p><p><strong>• How to promote us:</strong></p><p>Promote LMN Life using your affiliate link across social media, blogs, email marketing, or content platforms like Instagram, TikTok, and YouTube.</p><p><strong>• Where we sell to:</strong></p><p>We currently sell exclusively in Germany and Austria. Affiliate promotions should focus only on these markets.</p></div>",
